Key System"}],", an almost magical process can begin to unfold: you notice more, respond differently and act with greater intention."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"progressionNote","children":"It can feel magical, but it is not instant magic. The change comes from disciplined study, progressive practice and your willingness to apply each lesson."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"meetTariq section","id":"meet-tariq","children":[["$","figure",null,{"children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/images/tariq-happiness-harmony.png","alt":"Tariq Saddique, your Master Key System guide","loading":"lazy"}]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"FROM TIMELESS KNOWLEDGE TO LIVED EXPERIENCE"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Haanel created the system. Tariq helps you live it."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The book gives you the principles. My coaching gives you the structure, explanation and accountability to keep moving when the work becomes deeper—and when old habits try to pull you back."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"coachValue","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Clear weekly teaching"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Guided mental exercises"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Honest accountability"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Practical application"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"I will help you study each lesson in sequence, understand what it asks of you and connect the inner work to the goals, decisions and relationships that matter in your life."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"actions","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"primary","href":"#free-taster","children":"Experience my coaching free →"}],["$","a",null,{"className":"secondary","href":"mailto:toslondon9@gmail.com?subject=Master%20Key%20Discovery%20Call&body=Hello%20Tariq%2C%0A%0AI%27d%20like%20to%20learn%20more%20about%20your%20Master%20Key%20coaching.%0A%0AMy%20main%20goal%20is%3A%20","children":"Ask Tariq a question"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"ta